From 2f362c6c01e7f6211af4e6f1cabec0c14d6eaff8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Shuhao Zhang (Tony)" <5267690+ShuhaoZhangTony@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 25 Jul 2026 19:02:40 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(unified_comm): harden multi-NIC selection

Restrict auto-discovery to valid InfiniBand HCA names, preserve explicit NCCL selections, validate numeric tuning inputs, and cover environment/topology behavior with CPU unit tests.

Co-authored-by: Codex <codex@openai.com>

Signed-off-by: Shuhao Zhang (Tony) <5267690+ShuhaoZhangTony@users.noreply.github.com>
---
