 .../unified_comm/backends/nccl_backend.py     | 225 ++++--------------
 vllm/distributed/unified_comm/collective.py   |  38 +--
 4 files changed, 180 insertions(+), 192 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 tests/distributed/test_unified_comm_multi_nic.py

